<title>USA: TENNIS-LEADING RANKINGS ON WTA TOUR.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LEADING RANKINGS ON WTA TOUR.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Florida 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
